      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just to revive this canny request once more , i do really thing this is a much needed system as i see people on my Vrchat server get hacked accounts or similar everyday , the best solution is probably longer password , but typing in long password (i have a 20 digits password for example) inside of vr is not really nice to do , when on pc it isnt too bad as i can just copy it and then paste it\n\nAs i do work on a lot of worlds tho i also have to test them on quest and idk why but vrchat logs me out EVERY SINGLE time , and then i cant copy it and do have to manually type a 20 digit password with Symbols , Letters and number which is just a pain to do\n\nNow some people might say just take a shorter password , well i wish i could do that but even with 2FA and a short password i do not feel safe , i manage quite a big discord server and thus my thread model is quite high , thus i can not lower my security , i know this is probably more of a me problem but i do think that this will overall improve the vrchat security and ease of use quite a bit.\n\nLike i said i would already be fine with it just beeing a MFA option but Passwordless would be even more secure and way easier to use",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
