      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly being able to use a USB Security Key would make VRChat a lot more usable for creators. Every time we make a new project, it makes you sign back in, and enter your 2FA code. If we could instead just insert our security key and it just signs us in, that would be SO useful!",
