  "details": "Passkey support as a MFA or even Passwordless login method , being able to just type your name and then press a button on your phone would be very convenient as this would be so much easier than typing in a 2FA code while having a headset on your head.\n\nThis would also easily enable you to share passkeys with people that have to login to your account or your significant other or similar.",
